# Keep the build context lean and hermetic. None of these are consumed by
# deploy/docker/Dockerfile — dependencies are installed inside the image from
# the lockfiles. In particular, a host-local web/node_modules carries native
# bindings for the BUILDER's platform (e.g. darwin-arm64); copied into the
# linux/amd64 web-builder it shadows the freshly installed linux bindings and
# the rolldown/vite build fails with "Cannot find native binding".
**/node_modules
.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
